[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238857\">7045A10</a></p><p>Lift the seat completely.</p><p>1. Install the proper tool (1a) on the gas ring  (1b) device as\nshown in the figure.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.666.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Screw the nut of the tool (2a) ( compress the gas ring) so as\nto remove the pin (2b) of the gas ring from its seat (2c) in the\ntubolar.</p><p>While screwing the nut keep the tool in position.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>EXECUTE THE  OPERATION WITH THE GREATEST\nCARE.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>3. Wheel the tool group with gas ring as much as necessary then\nscrew the nut of the tool so as to remove the gas ring  completely</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>While screwing the nut keep the\ntool in position.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019366.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Make sure that the gas ring\ndevice is not damaged and that it provides a proper loading.</p><p>1. Place the head (1a) of the gas ring device  (1b) into its proper\nseat in the tubolar, then install the proper tool (1c) as shown\nin the figure.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.666.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Screw the nut (2a) of the tool (compress the gas ring) so as\nto match the pin (2b) of the device with its  seat (2c) in the tubolar.</p><p>While screwing the nut keep the tool in position.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>EXECUTE THE OPERATION WITH THE\nGREATEST CARE</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>3. Unscrew the nut of the tool so as to install into its seat the\ngas ring device completely.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>While screwing the nut keep the\ntool in position.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019367.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3238857\">7045A10</a></p><p>Check the functioning of the device.</p>"]]